            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-QUESTION-WORDS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "sentence_order", "prompt": "So'zlardan savol tuzing: siz qayerda yashaysiz?", "tokens": [ { "id": "t1", "text": "where" }, { "id": "t2", "text": "do" }, { "id": "t3", "text": "you" }, { "id": "t4", "text": "live" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOrder": ["t1", "t2", "t3", "t4"] }, "remediation": "Where + do + you + live." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-QUESTION-WORDS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "fill_blank", "prompt": "Bo'sh joyni to'ldiring (savol so'zi): u nima ish qiladi?", "segments": [ { "blankId": "b1" }, { "text": " does she do?" } ], "blanks": { "b1": { "accepted": ["What"] } }, "normalization": { "caseFold": true, "collapseWhitespace": true }, "remediation": "Nima = What." }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Savol so'zi gap boshida: what / where / who / when / how.\n- Tuzilma: **savol so'zi + do/does + ega + fe'l**.\n- he/she/it → **does**, asosiy fe'l -s siz." }
